  "body": "Set in a sought-after Millwater street, this impressive executive residence delivers the space, separation and quality modern families are looking for.\r\n\r\nElevated, private and beautifully finished, the home offers six bedrooms, three bathrooms and multiple living zones, with a flexible layout ideal for extended family, guests, teenagers, or granny-style living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is the main family hub, with four bedrooms, two spacious lounges, open-plan dining, a designer kitchen and a fully equipped butler's kitchen. Downstairs, two further bedrooms, a separate lounge and private entrance options create excellent separation for those who need extra space and independence.\r\n\r\nOutdoor living is a real highlight, with two separate entertaining areas, an elevated balcony and a private deck complete with spa pool.\r\n\r\nWith a double carpeted garage, separate laundry, gas hot water and quality finishes throughout, this is executive family living with room for everyone.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love It\r\n* Six bedrooms and three bathrooms\r\n* Three living areas in total\r\n* Four bedrooms upstairs\r\n* Two bedrooms downstairs plus lounge\r\n* Ideal extended family or granny-style setup\r\n* Designer kitchen plus butler's kitchen\r\n* Separate visitors' powder room\r\n* Two outdoor entertaining areas\r\n* Balcony with elevated outlook\r\n* Private deck with spa pool\r\n* Double carpeted garage\r\n* Elevated, private and beautifully finished\r\n\r\nGive us a call to arrange a viewing. We live and play local and are often only a phone call away - and only five minutes away to show you through today.\r\n\r\n11 Pekanga Road, Millwater\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35243",
